{"id":"19d9ef12fec056aa","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-linearfeq.md","title":"Linear Boolean function characterization","display":"thm-linearfeq — Linear Boolean function characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-linearfeq","aliases":["27-thm-linearfeq"],"display":"thm-linearfeq — Linear Boolean function characterization","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.12.1; Chapter 11 functional-equation viewpoint","source_printed_pages":"44–45, 488–491","source_pdf_pages":"68–69, 512–515","verification_status":"proved-in-note-standard-GF2-linear-map-characterization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-linearfeq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-linearfeq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-linearfeq — Linear Boolean function characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.1; Chapter 11 functional-equation viewpoint"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"44–45, 488–491"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"68–69, 512–515"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-standard-GF2-linear-map-characterization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；标量与向量异或见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>，空异或为 0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\bigoplus_{i\\in[n]}a_ix_i\\right)\\right)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x\\oplus y)=f(x)\\oplus f(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\bigoplus_{i\\in[n]}a_ix_i\\right)\\right)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x\\oplus y)=f(x)\\oplus f(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向左代入 x=y=0 得 f(0)=0；每个 x 是单位向量的异或，逐次用加法性得到 a_i=f(e_i)。向右由模 2 分配律直接成立。此处 linear 指 GF(2) 值函数的线性；不可与书中 affine zero-set class 混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；标量与向量异或见 [[27-df-boolop]]，空异或为 0。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(x)=\\bigoplus_{i\\in[n]}a_ix_i\\right)\\right)\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x\\oplus y)=f(x)\\oplus f(y)).","display":true}],"bytes":1386,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-451","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-linearfeq|thm-linearfeq — Linear Boolean function characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","11de8465f2282555"]}